{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415042","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415042","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041504201:1":{"text":"ヴェパリアン、お前は大人しく法具の研究だけをしていればいい。あれの所有者はこの俺だ、分かっているな？","source_cn":"维珀里安，我知道你在盘算什么，你要做的只有研究班题斯圣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0EEE9562B6313A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041504202:1":{"text":"もちろんだとも。勝利も敗北もしょせんは刹那的なもの。裏切らないのは永遠の知識だけだ。","source_cn":"当然，当然，胜利和失败都是一时的，只有永恒的知识，不会背叛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C4C9C33146D2E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041504203:1":{"text":"私の研究であなたは永遠に近い存在となった。だがまだ足りない、もっと鍛錬を積む必要がある……","source_cn":"在我的帮助下，您已经无限接近永恒，但这还不够，您还需要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC1D8E9D74567A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041504204:1":{"text":"そうすればあなたは再び立ち上がる。古い自分を殺すことで、より強くなるのだ。","source_cn":"锤炼，将让您再度崛起，只有杀死了旧的您，新的您才会更加强大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x169743A4E2C7D6B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041504205:1":{"text":"私の忠誠を疑う必要はない。私は今もあなたとの約束を守り、様々な方法で、あなたが望む強さを与えてきたではないか。","source_cn":"为什么要怀疑我的忠诚呢？我一直在践行给您的承诺——以各...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x325608B03B44D42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041504206:1":{"text":"私が何か間違ったことをしたかね？","source_cn":"难道我在您面前做错过什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE05FE18F0D52D43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041504207:1":{"text":"お前は優秀な部下であることは認めよう。","source_cn":"维珀里安，我不否认你是个优秀的下属。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7983B365993DF23F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041504208:1":{"text":"そのまま使える駒で居続けろよ。","source_cn":"但你最好确保，你一直对我有用。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x981FF102811108B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041504209:1":{"text":"でないと、お前とその蛇の背骨を、一つずつ握りつぶしてやるからな。","source_cn":"否则……我会一寸一寸捏碎你和你那条骨蛇的脊骨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA67CC783BA1342A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041504210:1":{"text":"苦痛は意志をさらなる高みへ導く……だが私には、まだそのような機会を与えてくれなくてもけっこうだ。","source_cn":"啊，苦痛确实能令意志更加伟大。不过您还不必将那种令人进...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BE46B8BC6C4298C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","doc